{"seq":2,"slug":"json-and-model-decoding","title":"JSON 与模型解码","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/json-and-model-decoding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"codable-basics","title":"Codable 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/json-and-model-decoding/codable-basics","wordCount":1617,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"decoding-strategies-pitfalls","title":"解码策略与陷阱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/json-and-model-decoding/decoding-strategies-pitfalls","wordCount":1853,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"networking-error-handling","title":"网络错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-networking-data-layer/json-and-model-decoding/networking-error-handling","wordCount":1888,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"json-与模型解码-简介\">JSON 与模型解码 简介</h1><p>网络取回的数据几乎总是 JSON——而 JSON 是无类型的字节，应用要用的是<strong>强类型的模型</strong>。这中间的「解码」是 iOS 数据层最常打交道的环节。本章讲清 Swift 的解码体系：先是 <code>Codable</code>/<code>Decodable</code> 的基础（声明遵循协议即自动获得解码、<code>CodingKeys</code> 映射字段名），然后是解码策略与陷阱（日期/蛇形命名策略、可选与默认值、嵌套与异构数据、最常见的解码错误），最后是网络错误处理（区分网络错误、HTTP 状态错误、解码错误，并给出清晰的错误类型）。掌握 Codable 与稳健的错误处理，让你把不可信的 JSON 安全地变成可信的模型。</p>\n"}